    "answer": "18 inches is equal to 18/12 = <<18/12=1.5>>1.5 feet.\nEach row is 120 feet long, so there are 120/1.5 = <<120/1.5=80>>80 18-inch lengths on which seeds can be planted.\n#### 80"
